('R02-00280','02_repeated_release','production','crypto/rsa/rsa_ossl.c','derive_kdk','462;468;471','FP','High','BN_free(d) at line 462 is followed by goto err. The line 468 free is also followed by goto err. The line 471 free is reached only after rsa->d exists and BN_bn2binpad succeeds. These are mutually exclusive paths; the shared err label at 521-524 does not free d again. The helper is called from rsa_ossl_private_decrypt at line 660.','Source-level review only; no runtime reproduction.'),
