('R04X-000061','04_acquire_early_return','production','crypto/evp/p_lib.c','EVP_PKEY_get1_encoded_public_key','1374;1376;1382;1385','FP','High','The immediate return at 1376 is the allocation-failure check (buf is NULL). The error return at 1382 follows OPENSSL_free(buf) at 1381. On success, ownership transfers through *ppub = buf at 1384 and the function returns the length at 1385; the public API is get1 and callers release the returned buffer.','Source-level review of complete function and call sites; no runtime reproduction.'),
